<![CDATA[<div style="font-size: 12pt;">Reminder - Broker has been submitted for review and is pending approval.&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Broker Account:&nbsp;{!Account.Link}</div>]]></td>
